---
import { company } from "../../data/company";
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
 
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
     <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div data-aos="fade-down">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[10px] border border-slate-100 shadow-sm mb-6">
          <span class="flex gap-1">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-400"></span>
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400"></span>
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
           </span>
          Soporte Directo
        </span>
      </div>

    <h2 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight" data-aos="fade-up">
        ¿Prefieres una atención <br/>
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-pink-500 via-orange-400 to-blue-600 italic font-serif">más personal?</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-8 text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
         Si tienes dudas sobre el proceso o prefieres agendar vía telefónica, nuestro equipo está listo para escucharte.
    </p>
    </div>

    <div 
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center items-center"
      data-aos="fade-up" 
      data-aos-delay="300"
    >
      <a
        href={`tel:${company.contact.phone}`}
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-slate-900 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] transition-all hover:bg-slate-800 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-[10px] group-hover:animate-bounce"></i>
        Llamar ahora
      </a>

      <a
        href={company.contact.linkWhatsapp}
        target="_blank"
        class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white border-2 border-slate-100 text-slate-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] transition-all hover:border-green-400 hover:text-green-600 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-lg"></i>
        WhatsApp Directo
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>